      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DIVOT (1) was well fancied as favourite latest and led for much of the way but faded to place, beaten 0.8 lengths (22.64) at this track in a Grade 4/5 over 400m. Solid formlines coming through his last run. One of the contenders. BOWIE SUNNY (2) has been settling off the speed lately, finishing fifth (25.13) last time in a Grade 5 at Sale. Solid record here winning three races. The form from her last run stacks up well. Great chance to atone. DEWANA HALF TAIL (3) could manage only fifth at Sandown last time but turned heads when posting a powerful 29.93 over 525m at The Meadows the start prior. Has the ability and looks a key chance. SILVER MACK (5) comes into calculations after placing most recently.",
